# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
**/doc/api/
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.pub-cache/
.pub/
/build/
/coverage/
# QA captures of this app are regenerated by a rebuild or `flutter test`;
# only the native iOS reference shots, which come from the sibling SwiftUI
# project, are worth keeping in the repo.
/outputs/screens/
/outputs/qa/flutter/
/outputs/*.png

# Symbolication related
app.*.symbols

# Obfuscation related
app.*.map.json

# Android Studio will place build artifacts here
/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release
